					"content": "這是你點的餐。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200260302
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200260302,
					"content": "哦！是按照我的要求特製的<color=#00E1FFFF>炸蘿蔔丸子</color>啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200260303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "厄尼斯特"
				},
				{
					"id": 200260303,
					"content": "果然，加了蛋類之後，口感和香氣都更好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200260304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "厄尼斯特"
				},
				{
					"id": 200260304,
					"content": "哈哈哈，我的品味果然是最棒的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200260305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "厄尼斯特"
				},
				{
					"id": 200260305,
					"content": "#對了，這是餐費，辛苦{F#妳}{M#你}了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "厄尼斯特"
